  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This serves 4 and takes about 50 minutes. The thing to watch is the fish: it needs very high heat and minimal moving so the skin crisps and chars properly. A fish that is moved too early will stick and tear."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Attieke is sold dried or pre-prepared. The dried version needs steaming first; the pre-prepared version just needs fluffing and warming. Check the packet before you start."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
